# Patterns excluded when packaging the chart.

# VCS / editor / OS
.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
.idea/
.vscode/
*.tmproj
*.swp
*.bak
*.orig
*~

# Test value matrices are a CI input, not part of the shipped artifact.
ci/

# README.md and UPGRADING.md are deliberately KEPT: `helm show readme` and
# ArtifactHub read them out of the packaged chart, and 2.0.0 is a breaking
# release whose upgrade notes must travel with it.
